OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 22 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores how
OL,6,     GPalestrina reinvents himself with
OL,7,     Ga new marriage, new trades, and
OL,8,     Gnew music of course, but also by
OL,9,     Gjoining a collective that
OL,10,     Gcelebrates his legacy.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GThe Callum Au quintet play live.
OL,13,     GJohn Gilhooly on Wigmore Hall's
OL,14,     G125th Anniversary Festival.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,18,     Gfavourites, with music by
OL,19,     GRachmaninov, Debussy and Amy
OL,20,     GBeach.
