OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GKaren Ni Bhroin conducts the BBC
OL,6,     GConcert Orchestra in music from
OL,7,     GTV period dramas, including
OL,8,     GBridgerton, Downton Abbey, Pride
OL,9,     Gand Prejudice, Sanditon and
OL,10,     Gothers.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,12,     FSt
OL,13,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a key
OL,14,     Gmoment in the life and work of
OL,15,     Gfive Black female musicians.
OL,16,     GToday she considers Billie
OL,17,     GHoliday's final performance of
OL,18,     Gthe iconic Strange Fruit.
